ckm3eoUysS3ksYW-DtXy4cY3GYY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0Kn9fYV8csUCytoa6JkqRcoFzZqSMhEsoPW3AqbXSVJA&oe=69F8AAF1"}, "display_name": "Video Poker VR", "keywords": ["casino", "poker", "cards", "relax"], "long_description": "Enjoy one of the most beloved casino games from the comfort of your home. Video Poker VR features all-you-can-play Jacks or Better video poker along with five other game modes. With classics likes Deuces Wild and Aces and Eights along with a new mode \"Five Fives\" you'll find a game you'll love to sit down and chill playing. \n\nFeatures \n\n- Six game modes: Jacks Or Better, Deuces Wild, Double Joker, Aces and Eights, Five Fives (NEW!, EXCLUSIVE), Pick and Draw \n- Play alongside NPC personalities including Smoking Martha! \n- Never pay for credits or sit around waiting for a time-based deposit, when you run out you can add more for free \n- Stats for how well you play over time (complete with a fancy graph)", "short_description": "Enjoy one of the most beloved casino games from the comfort of your home. Video Poker VR features all-you-can-play Jacks or Better video poker along with five other game modes. With classics likes Deuces Wild and Aces and Eights along with a new mode \"Five Fives\" you'll find a game you'll love to sit down and chill playing."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.videopokervr.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.videopokervr.com/terms-of-use/", "publisher_name": "Experience VR Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.videopokervr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SIMULATION", "CASUAL", "STRATEGY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb"